  "has_voiceover": false,
  "description": "StockTok Strategy Is Working...So We Double Down",
  "body_html": "<p>You have heard me say it a million times: when strategy is working, you double down and squeeze as much lemonade (money) out of these lemons (stocks) as possible. When strategy is not working, you find a enjoyable hobby lol. It is only January 13th, and we have our first stock over 41% gain, 2 stocks just over 20%  and another over 15%. I’d say these lemons need to be squeezed. </p><p>S&amp;P 500 is breaking all time highs and the VIX is trending well. There is no reason to be bearish (for now). If you didn’t see yesterday’s article, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-next-stock-to-add-to?r=4z8lgl\">Buying More Of This Stock</a>, I am keeping my eye out to add as well. </p><p>That said, there is 1 stock we traded last year for over 30% gain…and it is cracking local highs yet again, with a lot of institutional volume flowing in. </p><p>The stock is: </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "You have heard me say it a million times: when strategy is working, you double down and squeeze as much lemonade (money) out of these lemons (stocks) as possible. When strategy is not working, you find a enjoyable hobby lol. It is only January 13th, and we have our first stock over 41% gain, 2 stocks just over 20% and another over 15%. I’d say these lemons need to be squeezed.",
